well formed:
  num_hyps: 2
  nth_hyp 2: a hypothesis
  explode_sequent: <H>; x: _
a context with no variable parameter:
  num_hyps: refused (num_hyps: malformed context)
  nth_hyp 2: refused (nth_hyp: malformed context)
  explode_sequent: refused (dest_context: not a context)
a context with one subterm:
  num_hyps: refused (num_hyps: malformed context)
  nth_hyp 2: refused (nth_hyp: malformed context)
  explode_sequent: refused (dest_context: not a context)
a context whose body binds no variable:
  num_hyps: refused (num_hyps: malformed context)
  nth_hyp 2: refused (nth_hyp: malformed context)
  explode_sequent: refused (dest_context: wrong bvars)
a body that ends in no concl:
  num_hyps: refused (num_hyps: malformed sequent)
  nth_hyp 2: a hypothesis
  explode_sequent: refused (explode_sequent: malformed sequent)
a concl with two subterms:
  num_hyps: 2
  nth_hyp 2: a hypothesis
  explode_sequent: refused (explode_sequent: malformed sequent)
